Third-party note: crates/fz-core/vendor/libdeflate is libdeflate 1.26 by
Eric Biggers (MIT license, see its COPYING file) with a small FerroZip patch
adding libdeflate_deflate_compress_chunk().

RAR extraction (the default `rar` feature of fz-core) is
built from the unRAR source code, whose license permits free use and
redistribution but forbids using it to re-create the RAR compression
algorithm. Build with `--no-default-features` for a binary made only of
OSI-approved components.
